{"overview":"مارتین بست یک جراح درخشان است که ناگهان حرفه درخشان خود در بوستون را رها می‌کند تا پزشک عمومی یک روستای ماهیگیری عجیب و غریب در ساحل شرقی شود، جایی که تابستان‌های کودکی‌اش را در آنجا می‌گذراند. متأسفانه، رفتار رک و بی‌ادبانه مارتین در کنار تخت بیمارستان، مردم محلی عجیب و غریب و نیازمند را به اشتباه می‌اندازد و او به سرعت از شهر بیگانه می‌شود، حتی با اینکه او تنها کسی است که آنها دارند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Martin Best is a brilliant surgeon who abruptly leaves his illustrious career in Boston to become the general practitioner in a quaint East Coast fishing village where he spent summers as a child. Unfortunately, Martin's blunt and borderline rude bedside manner rubs the quirky, needy locals the wrong way, and he quickly alienates the town, even though he's all they’ve got.","tagline_en":"Small town doctor. Big time issues.","runtime":42,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/rEcPEK4RyA1sB96NfyVVJmyDKcv.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":7,"y":2026,"poster":"/gRf2g2iR8j2uMlClrNTaiHbrZ6c.jpg"}],"episodes":20,"crew":["Liz Tuccillo"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Josh Charles","role":"Dr. Martin Best","photo":"/xmFdIoFKVRNUmXaslBlErA3UHfF.jpg"},{"name":"ابیگیل اسپنسر","role":"Louisa Glasson","photo":"/uf96FDHVoFMwoiP5He4SPLCmwri.jpg","en":"Abigail Spencer"},{"name":"Josh Segarra","role":"Sheriff Mark Mylow","photo":"/vXhukEBgpI8jmCUCSGcpJCNzXHV.jpg"},{"name":"Cree","role":"Elaine Denham","photo":"/2qq7GobF9nS1mAARJj1Dyq0GPFL.jpg"},{"name":"Annie Potts","role":"Aunt Joan","photo":"/nugPVN28qOhOIoHawrDJ6fIfrxR.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Spinella","role":"Greg Garrison","photo":"/lJahZcmWjggljySaqnPyGIuOeXs.jpg"},{"name":"Jason Veasey","role":"George Brady","photo":"/veqGaitRHMv7v01WLPseYJ4AZLe.jpg"},{"name":"Eliza Coupe","role":"Eden Montgomery","photo":"/uscVJ5XW8pA74wPaT29OlIx1Fy5.jpg"}],"trailer":"NqBILOoDVm4","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/291084-best-medicine/w